OL,3,GNEWSAMum urges end to cancer benefits
OL,4,Await for children
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mum from Nottinghamshire whose child
OL,7,Fwas diagnosed with cancer said the
OL,8,Fthree-month wait to be eligible to
OL,9,Fclaim benefits must be scrapped.
OL,11,FRachael's daughter Mabel, now six, was
OL,12,Fdiagnosed with a rare type of kidney
OL,13,Fcancer in 2023.
OL,15,FCurrently, there is a three-month wait
OL,16,Fperiod for Disability Living Allowance
OL,17,F(DLA) and the charity Young Lives vs
OL,18,FCancer said children and young people
OL,19,Fwith cancer wait an average of seven
OL,20,Fmonths for payment of disability
OL,21,Fbenefits after diagnosis.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
